      "en": "Tankmonitor",
      "de": "Tankmonitor"
    },
    "desc": {
      "en": "Adapter to read tank levels from LiquidCheck (Grafana), Tankinhaltsanzeige and Oilview",
      "de": "Adapter zum Auslesen von Tankinhalt aus LiquidCheck (Grafana), Tankinhaltsanzeige und Oilview"
